WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.833
Sara looked at Rex.

2
00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:08.920
She looked at the rocks.

3
00:00:08.921 --> 00:00:13.297
"I'm sorry your tower fell," she said.

4
00:00:13.298 --> 00:00:16.822
Rex sighed.

5
00:00:16.823 --> 00:00:22.802
"It's okay."

6
00:00:22.803 --> 00:00:29.282
He stacked the rocks again.

7
00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:33.442
Sara walked through the woods.

8
00:00:33.443 --> 00:00:43.772
She shook her seed pods.

9
00:00:43.773 --> 00:00:47.276
"What do you have, Sara?" Tor asked.

10
00:00:47.277 --> 00:00:50.759
"Seed pods," Sara said.

11
00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:54.721
Rattle, rattle, rattle.

12
00:00:54.722 --> 00:00:58.937
"Nice music," Tor said.

13
00:00:58.938 --> 00:01:01.562
"I have an idea."

14
00:01:01.563 --> 00:01:04.328
Tor dug through her bag.

15
00:01:04.329 --> 00:01:08.297
She found a flute.

16
00:01:08.298 --> 00:01:11.534
Tweet!

17
00:01:11.535 --> 00:01:15.821
Sara and Tor played music.

18
00:01:15.822 --> 00:01:27.353
Rattle, rattle, tweet! Rattle, rattle, tweet!

19
00:01:27.354 --> 00:01:30.931
Sid walked over.

20
00:01:30.932 --> 00:01:34.583
He swung his tail to the beat.

21
00:01:34.584 --> 00:01:38.200
Sid slapped the ground.

22
00:01:38.201 --> 00:01:40.473
He used his tail.

23
00:01:40.474 --> 00:01:45.055
Whap . . . whap . . . whap!

24
00:01:45.056 --> 00:01:49.006
"That sounds good, Sid," Sara said.

25
00:01:49.007 --> 00:01:54.643
"We can be a band," Tor said.

26
00:01:54.644 --> 00:02:02.846
The three buddies played music.

27
00:02:02.847 --> 00:02:07.587
Some mice peeked out of a hole.

28
00:02:07.588 --> 00:02:12.249
"Be quiet!"

